# Space (live server): test-plan SP-02, the planet landing and the take-off (bugs B-01, B-02). Elanor
# (_login_space) wormholes to Endriago (GM `/wormhole 2210`: the hand-off, she arrives at Brendan's Weft), targets
# the planet Endriago (W, then the target panel's >> twice: Inward Belt Point 1, Endriago; net7 sector_objects 628,
# landable, gate_to 2295), warps to it (Q) and clicks its Land verb (the target panel's right verb, 1238,672:
# ACTION; Net-7 PlayerConnection.cpp action 29 answers a CLIENT_SOUND only). The client's planet-landing camera
# (state 7, CameraController07Class, camctrl_pland.cpp 0x794A90) holds a place for about 4 s while the ship flies
# its spline (B-01: the spline's length, speeds, tangents and end key), then the client sends ACTION and the server
# hands off to the surface, Porvenir Mons Area (2295; its sector-entry camera after START_ACK). There W targets
# the Launchpad to Endriago Sector (net7 629, a stargate to 2210) and its verb gates: the gate opens, CAMERA_CONTROL
# 4 about 6 s later, and on a planet the client runs the take-off camera (state 9, CameraController09Class,
# camctrl_takeoff.cpp 0x796440 / 0x796920; B-02: the camera's cast box): the camera holds a place and turns after
# the ship as it climbs away, about 0.6 s, then the client's ACTION, the hand-off, Endriago's space and its entry
# camera. Shots during the landing hold the ship's place along the spline in their draw logs (each draw's world).
#   e2e.py --live [--retail] --db-snapshot 7 --camera-track --instance NAME run sp_land
name: space: land on Endriago, take off from its launchpad (SP-02)
timeout: 480
include _login_space
key 0x0D
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
text '/wormhole 2210'
key 0x0D
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' within 60
wait-event antprox 'received START_ACK$' within 120
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 60
key 0x57 until antprox 'sent SET_TARGET$' every 1.5 within 15
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
click 1248,987 until antprox 'sent SET_TARGET$' every 1.5 within 15
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
click 1248,987 until antprox 'sent SET_TARGET$' every 1.5 within 15
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot planet_target
key 0x51
expect-event antprox 'received WARP$' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent WARP_INDEX$' within 120
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot at_planet
click 1238,672 until antprox 'received ACTION$' every 3 within 60
wait-since antprox 'received ACTION$' 1
shot land_1s
wait-since antprox 'received ACTION$' 2.5
shot land_2s5
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' within 30
move 1000,880
wait-event antprox 'received START_ACK$' within 120
wait-event antprox 'sent CAMERA_CONTROL$' within 30
wait-since antprox 'sent CAMERA_CONTROL$' 6
shot surface
key 0x57 until antprox 'sent SET_TARGET$' every 1.5 within 15
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot launchpad_target
click 1238,672 until antprox 'received ACTION$' every 3 within 30
expect-event antprox 'sent ACTIVATE_NEXT_RENDER_STATE$' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent CAMERA_CONTROL$' within 30
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' within 30
move 1000,880
wait-event antprox 'received START_ACK$' within 120
wait-event antprox 'sent CAMERA_CONTROL$' within 30
wait-since antprox 'sent CAMERA_CONTROL$' 6
shot endriago_space
expect-no CRASH
